00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:32.560
This is probably an off brand, generic

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:36.200
which is totally cool as
long as it's compatible

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:39.063
with your current device,
you should be fine.

00:04:40.802 --> 00:04:43.220
A little bit of this honey.

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:44.143
Just a little.

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:48.791
And I think our upgrade's complete.

00:04:48.791 --> 00:04:49.874
Let's try it.

00:04:52.133 --> 00:04:53.830
It's really hot, oh my gosh.

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:54.663
This is great.

00:04:54.663 --> 00:04:58.867
I definitely recommend this
version to everyone, for sure.

00:05:05.147 --> 00:05:06.160
Well thank you guys so much for watching.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:08.260
